  "version": "1.0",
  "meta": {
    "id": "smart-farm",
    "name": {
      "zh": "智慧农场（大棚-水泵房-气象站种子场景）",
      "en": "Smart farm (greenhouse + pump room + weather station seed scenario)"
    },
    "description": {
      "zh": "一座小型设施农场（平面 24×12m，坐标单位=米，x 右/y 下，原点左上）：2 座连栋大棚 + 水泵房 + 露天田 + 气象站（type=outdoor，经围护与大棚耦合，是天气事件的入口）。灌溉剧本：6:00 / 18:00 大棚土壤墒情下降（soil-moisture 降至 25/28，农艺师开泵灌溉）；午后剧本：13:00 大棚 B 高温（38°C，需通风+降温协作）；15:00 气象站测得降雨（湿度 96，经围护渗入）。气象监测员只有感知能力，执行全靠农艺师——典型的「感知-行动」分离协作结构。内嵌 2 条确定性业务 Flow：墒情下降事件自动开泵灌溉、大棚 B 超 36°C 自动开风机通风——触发即执行，不经过 LLM，与农艺师的 Agent 决策并存。验证点：墒情事件触发灌溉决策与确定性 Flow 双通道；大棚高温经邻接通道向水泵房缓慢扩散；降雨经气象站-围护通道影响大棚湿度。（v2.1 刷新：节点全部对齐引擎可执行命令面，内嵌 2 条确定性 Flow）",
      "en": "A small facility farm (24×12m footprint, units=meters, x right / y down, origin top-left): 2 connected greenhouses + a pump room + an open field + a weather station (type=outdoor, coupled to the greenhouses through the envelope, the entry point for weather events). Irrigation script: 6:00 / 18:00 greenhouse soil moisture drops (soil-moisture to 25/28, agronomist starts the pump); midday script: 13:00 greenhouse B high temperature (38°C, needs ventilation + cooling collaboration); 15:00 weather station measures rainfall (humidity 96, diffuses in via the envelope). The weather watcher only senses — every action is the agronomist's, a textbook sense-act separation. Two deterministic flows are embedded: auto-pump irrigation on soil-moisture-drop events, and auto-ventilation when greenhouse B exceeds 36°C — fired deterministically, no LLM in the loop, coexisting with the agronomist's agent decisions. Verification points: soil-moisture events trigger BOTH the agronomist's decisions and the deterministic flow; greenhouse heat diffuses slowly to the pump room via adjacency; rainfall affects greenhouse humidity via the weather-station–envelope path. (v2.1 refresh: node capabilities aligned to the engine command surface; 2 embedded deterministic flows)"
    },
    "tagline": {
      "zh": "墒情告急、大棚 38°C、午后降雨——感知与行动分离的农场，农艺师与气象员的协作日常",
      "en": "Dry soil, a 38°C greenhouse, afternoon rain — a farm where sensing and acting live in different agents."
    },
    "heroEventId": "midday-heat-b",
    "recommendedPlaybackRate": 60,
    "storeyHeight": 4
  },
